Package: dankoiptv
Version: 1.0.0-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Danko Petro <danko@local>
Installed-Size: 82
Depends: python3-pyqt6, libmpv2, python3-requests
Section: video
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/dankopetro/dankoiptv
Description: Advanced IPTV Player with seamless reconnection for Linux Mint 22.3+
 Dankoiptv combines libmpv embedded via ctypes and a robust PyQt6 interface
 with production-verified seamless live stream reconnection (keep-open + eof-reached
 observer with cascade backoff).
